                                "sense_id": "0e7379ff-78e5-3eb8-bc4e-84001ed736c7",
                                "text": "[Japan] will not remember our American and English missionaries as she remembers even now those great Chinese priests who once educated her youth. And she will not preserve relics of our sojourn, carefully wrapped in septuple coverings of silk, and packed way in dainty whitewood boxes, because we had no new lesson of beauty to teach her,—nothing by which to appeal to her emotions."
                            },
